"""
Test /match-requirement with synthetic requirements.

Two test cases:
1. PASS: Requirement that refines AC-2 (more specific than control)
2. FAIL: Requirement that conflicts with AC-2 (contradicts control mandate)

Both pass /create-evidence-case (valid, grounded, same technique).
The difference is in the /lean4-prove relationship classification.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

